; Invisible 1px meter: reserves transparent padding so snapping to a screen edge leaves a gap
[MeterPad]
Meter=Shape
UpdateDivider=-1
X=((#CardW#+#ActiveFrameW#-1)*#UiScale#)
Y=((#CardH#+#ActiveFrameH#-1)*#UiScale#)
Shape=Rectangle 0,0,(1*#UiScale#),(1*#UiScale#)| Fill Color 0,0,0,1 | StrokeWidth 0
